# Angular frontend layer

- Full policy: `.agents/policies/angular-frontend.md` and `.agents/policies/integration.md`.
- Stack: Angular 22 / RxJS / PWA (TypeScript 6+, Node 22+).
- Data source: sibling `../home-api` (`environment.apiUrl` / `wsUrl`). Do not invent endpoints that diverge from the approved contract or OpenAPI.
- Keep feature DTOs/mappers/repositories colocated. Never hand-edit generated OpenAPI types; regenerate from `../home-api/docs/openapi.yaml`.
- Feature folders: root page in the feature dir; routed children each in their own named subfolder; parent-only children under `components/<name>/`.
- Preserve decimal strings at the HTTP boundary. Normalize errors via `AppError`. Use `switchMap`, `finalize`, and `takeUntilDestroyed` deliberately.
- UI strings: `src/app/core/i18n/en.json` and `es.json` only. Use `i18n.t('key')`.
- Prefer delegating substantive frontend work to the `angular-frontend` subagent with a filled `.agents/HANDOFF.md` block.
- Never `@apply` Tailwind opacity variants on CSS-variable theme colors (e.g. `bg-error-container/30`); use template utilities or `color-mix`/`var(--md-*)`. Re-run `npm run build:prod` after SCSS changes.
